scnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"46.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"7.799999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,93.5 9.1,97.2 14.2,92.8 19.3,87.9 24.5,92.3 29.6,86.7 34.7,85.2 39.8,84.6 44.9,74.7 50.0,67.8 55.1,70.9 60.3,64.9 65.4,66.8 70.5,62.3 75.6,61.0 80.7,55.5 85.8,46.7 91.0,45.6 96.1,47.2 101.2,50.5 106.3,39.7 111.4,19.6 116.5,28.1 121.6,19.9 126.8,20.7 131.9,28.9 137.0,28.7 142.1,28.7 147.2,30.4 152.3,27.8 157.4,37.5 162.6,35.9 167.7,40.8 172.8,44.7 177.9,41.5 183.0,37.1 188.1,31.5 193.2,35.9 198.4,33.8 203.5,18.9 208.6,27.5 213.7,26.3 218.8,12.8 223.9,17.0 229.0,13.2 234.2,13.0 239.3,22.6 244.4,28.7 249.5,24.6 254.6,29.8 259.7,32.8 264.9,35.6 270.0,30.2 275.1,31.3 280.2,27.4 285.3,25.7 290.4,28.6 295.5,32.2 300.7,27.9 305.8,39.3 310.9,46.0 316.0,51.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 101.2 62.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 152.3 39.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 172.8 56.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"51.7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8p